lds the lock during network calls, and state is in-memory only.\n\nNothing is committed, and nothing was sent to any external service. The one outside request was a web search for Intervals' scope and token documentation.","ttft_ms":2446,"type":"result","duration_ms":108024,"uuid":"0cda33b8-975d-4b02-8a35-8adc93db0fc7","ttft_stream_ms":2398,"time_to_request_ms":39,"first_content_frame_ms":2398,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":13524,"outputTokens":21522,"cacheReadInputTokens":373252,"cacheCreationInputTokens":36111,"webSearchRequests":1,"costUSD":0.03306812,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":11070,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
